  "content": "<p><em>這是一個函式庫模組，單獨使用時功能有限。若發現任何錯誤或問題，請至<a href=\"https://github.com/BiggerSeries/Phosphophyllite/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github Issues頁面</a>回報，而非在此處提交！提交前請先確認是否已有相同錯誤回報。</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Discord伺服器：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/K64HC88\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/K64HC88</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>本函式庫<strong>Phosphophyllite</strong>為Bigger系列模組所使用，需搭配以下模組方能發揮作用：</p><p>• <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biggerreactors\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bigger Reactors</a></p><p>• <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/resourceful-bees\" rel=\"nofollow\">Resourceful Bees</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>本專案採用<a href=\"https://github.com/BiggerSeries/BiggerSeries/blob/master/LICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">LGPL v2.1授權條款</a>。</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
